#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wifimanager/utils/wireless-form.js
msgid "A Wireless backup is created before the change. If the new interface does not appear, the previous wireless configuration is restored automatically."
msgstr "更改前会创建无线备份。如果新接口未出现，将自动恢复之前的无线配置。"

msgid "A backup always contains the network configuration it was taken from. A custom selection is still validated against the areas a restore needs to rebuild the bridge."
msgstr ""

msgid "A backup copies configuration files only; it contains no passwords from the UI. Wi-Fi keys are part of the wireless configuration and are therefore inside an unencrypted archive, which is why the file permissions are owner-only."
msgstr ""

msgid "A copy with a current manifest and checksums is created in the backup store. The original archive in /etc/meshassistant/backup stays untouched."
msgstr ""

msgid "A device"
msgstr "某设备"

msgid "A full pre-restore backup is created before any configuration file is changed."
msgstr ""

msgid "A full pre-restore backup is created unless it is disabled in the backup settings."
msgstr ""

msgid "A missing signal value is recorded as unknown instead of 0 dBm."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wifimanager/utils/wireless.js
msgid "A passphrase is required for this encryption mode."
msgstr "此加密模式需要密码。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/wifimanager/utils/wireless-form.js
msgid "A passphrase is stored on the router. Leave this blank to keep it; type a new one to replace it."
msgstr "路由器上已保存密码。留空则保留；输入新密码则替换。"

msgid "A port that is not already part of another bridge and does not carry the WAN uplink. If it is in the LAN bridge, the mesh engine removes it from the bridge and records what it removed so disabling the mesh can restore it."
msgstr "该端口尚未属于其他网桥，也不承载 WAN 上行。如果它在 LAN 网桥中，mesh 引擎会将其移出网桥并记录移除了什么，以便关闭 mesh 时恢复。"

msgid "A restore validates the archive, creates the pre-restore backup, applies the selected scope, verifies the result and rolls back automatically when the device does not come back."
msgstr ""

msgid "A roam is inferred when the same MAC is seen on a different BSS in the next sample; the exact transition time is unknown."
msgstr ""

msgid "A runtime value the driver does not expose stays “-”; it is never guessed from the configuration."
msgstr ""

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/wifi/mlo.js
msgid "A standalone MLO interface can be created here without using Mesh. It needs at least two radios, and saving switches those radios to EHT mode. Mesh Settings has a separate MLO option for the mesh access point; the two paths do not share a wireless section."
msgstr "可在此创建独立 MLO 接口，无需使用 Mesh。它需要至少两个射频，保存后这些射频会切换到 EHT 模式。Mesh 设置中另有用于 Mesh 接入点的 MLO 选项；两条路径不共用无线配置节。"

msgid "A suggestion is shown only when a band has at least five associated clients; the values are a snapshot and are never applied automatically."
msgstr "仅当某频段有至少五个已关联客户端时才显示建议；这些数值只是一次快照，绝不会自动应用。"

msgid "A wired backhaul is configured but no port is attached. Save and apply to let the engine attach it, or check that the port is usable."
msgstr ""

