#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "Archives are created atomically and kept with owner-only permissions. The newest backups are kept according to the retention settings. The comparison covers the files stored in the newest unencrypted backup; an encrypted archive or a damaged file is reported as unknown, and files outside the backup scope are not compared."
msgstr "归档文件以原子方式创建，并保持仅所有者可访问的权限。最新备份按保留设置保存。对比范围仅限最新未加密备份中存储的文件；加密归档或损坏文件会被报告为未知，备份范围之外的文件不参与对比。"

