#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "WiFi Manager Backup or OpenWrt Sysupgrade Backup?"
msgstr "WiFi管家备份还是 OpenWrt Sysupgrade 备份？"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "WiFi Manager Backup stores and restores only the configuration files in the selected scope. A restore replaces or merges those files, can restart the network, and can make this page unreachable."
msgstr "WiFi管家备份只保存和恢复所选范围内的配置文件。恢复会替换或合并这些文件，可能重启网络，并使此页面暂时无法访问。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "OpenWrt Sysupgrade Backup is a separate mechanism: it covers the whole system configuration and is applied by the firmware during an upgrade. WiFi Manager neither creates nor replaces it."
msgstr "OpenWrt Sysupgrade 备份是另一种机制：它覆盖整个系统配置，并在升级时由固件应用。WiFi管家既不会创建也不会替换它。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "Use a Sysupgrade backup before flashing firmware. Use a WiFi Manager backup to undo a WiFi, mesh or roaming change without touching the rest of the system."
msgstr "刷写固件前请使用 Sysupgrade 备份。若要撤销 WiFi、Mesh 或漫游更改而不影响系统其余部分，请使用 WiFi管家备份。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "Even a Full backup is limited to the configuration files WiFi Manager knows about; it is not a system image."
msgstr "即使是完整备份，也只包含 WiFi管家所知的配置文件；它不是系统镜像。"

