msgid "One row per device. MAC address, role, CPU load, channel, memory and client count are the values that device announces for itself; a value an older announcement does not carry stays empty instead of being guessed. Signal is the strongest backhaul signal reported for that device. Node state is normal, weak signal (a wireless-only backhaul below -75 dBm) or offline (no announcement for two minutes)."
msgstr "每台设备一行。MAC 地址、角色、CPU 负载、信道、内存和客户端数量都是该设备自行通告的值；旧版通告不包含的值保持空白，不做推测。信号是该设备报告的最强回程信号。节点状态分为正常、信号较差（仅无线回程且低于 -75 dBm）和离线（两分钟没有通告）。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "FT over DS (fast transition over the distribution system)"
msgstr "FT over DS（基于分发系统的快速切换）"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "Off sends the fast-transition frames over the air, which is the hostapd default and works without a wired path between the access points. On sends them over the distribution system; enable it only when every AP of the mobility domain is reachable over the wired network. hostapd supports one transport per interface, so this selects DS instead of air rather than both."
msgstr "关闭时快速切换帧通过空口发送，这是 hostapd 的默认值，且不要求各接入点之间存在有线路径。开启时通过分发系统发送；仅当漫游域内所有 AP 都能通过有线网络到达时才应启用。hostapd 每个接口只支持一种传输方式，因此这里是用 DS 替代空口，而不是同时使用两者。"

