msgid "The mesh encryption differs between nodes. Every node must use the same 802.11s encryption."
msgstr "节点之间的 mesh 加密方式不一致。每个节点必须使用相同的 802.11s 加密。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/mesh/topology.js
msgid "The mesh radios have no frequency band in common. At least two nodes must run the mesh on the same band to link directly."
msgstr "各节点的 mesh 射频没有共同的频段。至少两个节点必须在同一频段上运行 mesh 才能直接互联。"

