#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "The service state is read from init.d; the parameters are the values the managed DAWN configuration holds. DAWN is managed only while mesh networking and 802.11k or 802.11v are enabled."
msgstr "服务状态读取自 init.d；参数为受管 DAWN 配置中的值。只有在 mesh 组网且启用 802.11k 或 802.11v 时才会管理 DAWN。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "802.11k/v/r status"
msgstr "802.11k/v/r 状态"

