msgid "802.11k configured"
msgstr "已配置 802.11k"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "802.11v configured"
msgstr "已配置 802.11v"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "No access point is configured."
msgstr "未配置任何接入点。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "802.11v is enabled but this wpad build cannot send BSS transition requests. The radio flags are written, yet no steering request reaches the client."
msgstr "已启用 802.11v，但此 wpad 版本无法发送 BSS 转换请求。射频标志已写入，但客户端不会收到引导请求。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "The flags are the values stored in /etc/config/wireless for each AP section. hostapd reads them at start, so a change takes effect after Wi-Fi is reloaded."
msgstr "这些标志是 /etc/config/wireless 中各 AP 段存储的值。hostapd 在启动时读取，因此修改需重新加载 Wi-Fi 后生效。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "Recent roaming events"
msgstr "最近的漫游事件"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "No roaming event has been recorded yet."
msgstr "尚未记录任何漫游事件。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "All roaming events"
msgstr "全部漫游事件"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "The sampler compares the station table every 15 seconds. A join and a leave between two samples are not visible, and disconnect duration, reconnect duration and packet loss are recorded as unavailable."
msgstr "采样器每 15 秒比对一次站点表。两次采样之间的接入与离开无法看到，断开时长、重连时长和丢包率均记为不可用。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "DAWN log"
msgstr "DAWN 日志"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "Open the log viewer"
msgstr "打开日志查看器"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/diagnostics/roaming.js
msgid "The last 80 lines that syslog carries for the dawn service."
msgstr "syslog 中 dawn 服务的最后 80 行。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/mesh/topology.js
msgid "Every visible device is drawn. The rings follow the routing hops from this device; a line runs from one device to the next hop on the path to it, using the medium the link was reported with. Two devices joined by both media are drawn with solid and dashed links."
msgstr "所有可见设备都会被绘制。圆环表示距离本设备的路由跳数；连线从一台设备指向通往它的下一跳，并使用该链路报告的介质。同时通过两种介质相连的两台设备会画成实线与虚线连线。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/dawn.js
msgid "802.11k neighbor reports"
msgstr "802.11k 邻居报告"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/dawn.js
msgid "802.11v client steering"
msgstr "802.11v 客户端引导"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "Source SSID"
msgstr "源 SSID"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "Destination SSID"
msgstr "目标 SSID"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "Source BSSID"
msgstr "源 BSSID"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "Destination BSSID"
msgstr "目标 BSSID"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "The station table and the mesh link state are sampled every 15 seconds, so a client that joins and leaves between two samples is not recorded."
msgstr "站点表与 mesh 链路状态每 15 秒采样一次，因此在两次采样之间接入并离开的客户端不会被记录。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/events.js
msgid "For a roam, the source RSSI is the last value seen on the old BSS and the destination RSSI is the first value seen on the new one, up to 15 seconds apart."
msgstr "对于漫游，源 RSSI 是在旧 BSS 上看到的最后一个值，目标 RSSI 是在新 BSS 上看到的第一个值，两者最多相隔 15 秒。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "Enable 802.11k neighbor reports"
msgstr "启用 802.11k 邻居报告"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "802.11k lets a client ask its access point for a list of neighbouring access points. DAWN and the client use these radio measurements to decide where to roam."
msgstr "802.11k 允许客户端向其接入点索取相邻接入点列表。DAWN 和客户端利用这些无线测量来决定漫游目标。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "Enable 802.11v client steering"
msgstr "启用 802.11v 客户端引导"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "802.11v lets the access point suggest a better access point to a client. DAWN uses it to steer clients; without wpad support for 802.11v the neighbor reports still work, but no steering request is sent."
msgstr "802.11v 允许接入点向客户端推荐更合适的接入点。DAWN 借此引导客户端；若 wpad 不支持 802.11v，邻居报告仍然有效，但不会发送引导请求。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/roaming/settings.js
msgid "DAWN is not installed. 802.11k and 802.11v can still be enabled, but there is no client-steering service."
msgstr "未安装 DAWN。仍可启用 802.11k 和 802.11v，但没有客户端引导服务。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/overview.js
msgid "Always"
msgstr "始终"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/restore.js
msgid "If the restored configuration cuts off the path to this router, the automatic rollback cannot reach it either. Be ready to reach the device over the local network, the serial console or failsafe mode."
msgstr "如果恢复的配置切断了通往本路由器的路径，自动回滚同样无法访问它。请提前准备通过本地网络、串口控制台或 failsafe 模式访问设备。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/restore.js
msgid "The restored configuration is applied before it is verified: network, wireless, mesh and DAWN are started from the restored files and checked. If they do not come up, the previous files are restored from the snapshot, reloaded and the restore is reported as rolled back."
msgstr "恢复的配置会先被应用，然后再进行校验：网络、无线、Mesh 和 DAWN 会按恢复后的文件启动并检查。若它们未能启动，则从快照还原先前的文件、重新加载，并把本次恢复报告为已回滚。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/backup/settings.js
msgid "Every restore first creates a full pre-restore backup. This cannot be turned off: the in-memory snapshot used for the automatic rollback does not survive a reboot, so the archive is the copy that remains."
msgstr "每次恢复都会先创建一份完整的恢复前备份。此项无法关闭：用于自动回滚的内存快照不会在重启后保留，因此归档才是真正留存的那份副本。"

#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/wifimanager/overview.js
msgid "Mesh runtime"
msgstr "Mesh 运行状态"

